# Plans & Search Data

## Plan resolution (`getPlanById` in `data/demo-search.js`)

Order:
1. `loadGeneratedPlans()` from sessionStorage **or** localStorage
2. `getDemoPlan()` — rebuild from `parsePlanId()`
3. `getHardcodedSamplePlan()` — Sharm / Dahab from `data/sample-plans.js`

Never show empty plan page — default id: `demo-south_sinai-balanced` (Sharm). Dahab: `demo-south_sinai-economy` or city name contains `دهب`/`dahab`.

## Search criteria shape

```js
{
  budget, city_name, city_slug,
  people_count, duration_days,
  trip_types, templates, custom_notes, lang
}
```

Always save with `saveLastSearch()` before/after search. Plans via `saveGeneratedPlans()`.

## Hardcoded vs AI

- **Hardcoded**: prices, structure, sample summaries, image slot captions (`sample-plans.js`)
- **Gemini**: rich hotel/activity/transport text, reviews, item labels

## Catalog & display names

Pass **`displayName`** (typed city) into `catalogSummary` / `catalogPlanItems` so results match user input (e.g. "شرم الشيخ" not only governorate name).

## Plan detail render guard

`renderPlanDetailPage()` needs `plan.hotel` + `plan.breakdown` — always run `enrichDemoPlan(plan, criteria)` first.
